       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COREBANK-WIRE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  BALANCE     PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       01  AMOUNT      PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01  FEE         PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 1.50.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ADD AMOUNT TO BALANCE
           SUBTRACT FEE FROM BALANCE
           IF BALANCE < 0 DISPLAY "OVERDRAFT"
           ELSE DISPLAY BALANCE END-IF
           STOP RUN.
